WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue { color: yellow; }
::cue { color: cyan; }
::cue { color: lime; }
::cue { color: white; }

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.320 align:start position:20% line:83%
<c.white> </c>

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Yeah.</c>

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Please, tell President Lassiter</c>
<c.white>I'll call him back.</c>

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I'm late as it is.</c>

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:39.680 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I know he called before.</c>

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:41.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Yeah.</c>

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Excuse me, Mr President.</c>
<c.yellow>Sir, you forgot Kevin Barkovsky.</c>

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I'm sure I did.</c><c.yellow> He's been waiting</c>
<c.yellow>in the Roosevelt room.</c>

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.960 align:middle position:50% line:70%
<c.white>Who is he?</c><c.yellow> One of the candidates</c>
<c.yellow>to paint your official presidential</c>
<c.yellow>portrait.</c>

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>It's a put-up job, Charlie,</c>
<c.white>a conspiracy.</c>

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.680 align:start position:20% line:77%
<c.white>Official presidential portraits</c>
<c.white>aren't official at all.</c>

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>It's Abbey who wants it.</c>
<c.white>Send Mr Barkovsky on his way.</c>

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Every President has one, sir.</c>
<c.white>I'm not sitting for any portrait,</c>

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>unless, of course, you dig up</c>
<c.white>Gilbert Stuart.</c>

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.400 align:start position:20% line:77%
<c.white>Or who did Lincoln?</c><c.yellow> I have no idea.</c>
<c.white> </c>

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:12.400 align:middle position:50% line:70%
<c.white>Funny, when you think of Lincoln,</c>
<c.white>you think of the photographs,</c>
<c.white>how he aged,</c>

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>particularly that last one,</c>
<c.white>where the plate broke.</c>

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:16.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>56, and he looked ancient.</c>
<c.yellow>It's Leo.</c>

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I'm late.</c>

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:24.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>LEO: General Alexander is</c>
<c.yellow>waiting in the Oval.</c>

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:26.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I should have brought my tie.</c>

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>We've got a situation.</c>

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:30.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Of course we do.</c>

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:33.680 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>General, you have a tie?</c>

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:38.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Mr President, several hours ago,</c>
<c.cyan>protesters began gathering in Riyadh</c>

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:42.080 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>calling for free speech, press,</c>
<c.cyan>and popular elections.</c>

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.800 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>It's in the streets.</c>

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:45.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Already maybe a thousand.</c>

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:47.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Midnight over there,</c>
<c.cyan>and it's still growing.</c>

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:49.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Who's leading the protest?</c>

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>We don't know.</c>

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:53.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>State's calling the embassy,</c>
<c.cyan>waking everyone up.</c>

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.360 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>One thing's clear, Mr President.</c>

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:58.080 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>In Riyadh, this has never</c>
<c.cyan>happened before.</c>

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Leo?</c>

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:04.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Free speech is good.</c>

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:08.360 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Free-for-all for a quarter</c>
<c.yellow>of the world's oil reserves</c>

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:10.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>laced with rabid</c>
<c.yellow>anti-American sentiment...</c>

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:14.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Yeah.</c>

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.520 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.lime>Ten-hut.</c>

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:12.800 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>Gentlemen.</c><c.yellow> Sir.</c>

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:17.320 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>Please. Did you reach</c>
<c.white>Secretary Berryhill?</c>

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:18.600 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Sir, he's in Tokyo.</c>

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:21.160 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>He'd like to fly to Jordan</c>
<c.yellow>to monitor the situation.</c>

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:23.200 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>Good. General?</c>

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:25.640 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.cyan>The number in the streets seems now</c>
<c.cyan>to be several thousand.</c>

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.920 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.cyan>Primarily students and young</c>
<c.cyan>clerics, Mr President.</c>

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:30.320 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.cyan>And they seem to be using</c>
<c.cyan>anti-American rhetoric,</c>

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:31.800 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.cyan>yet demanding democratic reforms.</c>

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:34.080 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Are they armed?</c>
<c.lime>CNN's reporting they're not.</c>

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.200 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>George, do we have any real</c>
<c.white>intelligence on these people?</c>

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.080 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.cyan>Mr President, our intel</c>
<c.cyan>in Riyadh</c>

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:41.520 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.cyan>is only slightly better than</c>
<c.cyan>in the rest of the Middle East.</c>

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.640 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Which is to say lousy.</c>

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.760 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.lime>Sir, the good news is,</c>
<c.lime>at the moment</c>

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.600 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.lime>the Saudis are very concerned</c>
<c.lime>with their image in the West.</c>

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:49.760 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.lime>If the demonstrations</c>
<c.lime>remain non-violent...</c>

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:52.000 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>We have some time before they</c>
<c.white>start breaking legs?</c>

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.120 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>I think public beheading's</c>
<c.yellow>are more their style.</c>

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.640 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.lime>It will give us a chance to</c>
<c.lime>establish contact</c>

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.280 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.lime>with the leaders of the protest.</c>

00:03:58.320 --> 00:03:59.680 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.lime>If they are democratic...</c>

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.160 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>Sir, I don't need to remind you</c>

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.440 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>that any sort of chaos on</c>
<c.white>the Arabian peninsula</c>

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:05.440 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>could destabilise</c>
<c.white>the entire Middle East,</c>

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.360 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>throw the global economy</c>
<c.white>into crisis.</c>

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:09.800 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.cyan>And if this is a Trojan horse for</c>
<c.cyan>a fundamentalist coup...</c>

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.440 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>We better start buying hybrids.</c>
<c.white>And gas masks.</c>

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.400 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>Mr President,</c>
<c.white>the devil you know...</c>

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.480 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>Is one I'm pretty tired</c>
<c.white>of dancing with.</c>

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.120 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>Get me better intelligence.</c>
<c.white>And, Leo,</c>

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.200 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>let's get the Ambassador</c>
<c.white>in here first thing.</c>

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.400 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>Thanks, everybody.</c>

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.040 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white> </c><c.lime> Thank you, Mr President.</c>

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.880 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white> </c><c.yellow> You want the latest on Riyadh?</c>
<c.yellow>So do I.</c>

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:27.040 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>We can watch CNN together.</c>

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.800 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>CJ, any update on former</c>
<c.white>President Lassiter's condition?</c>

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:32.400 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>President Lassiter is recovering</c>
<c.yellow>nicely from the operation,</c>

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:34.200 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>and if I took as many trips</c>
<c.yellow>abroad as he does</c>

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.960 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>I'd have to get my hip</c>
<c.yellow>replaced as well.</c>

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.200 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Now let me see if I can answer</c>
<c.yellow>the rest of your questions</c>

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:39.920 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>before you ask them</c>
<c.yellow>so I can get dressed.</c>

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.440 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Yes, the President will be attending</c>

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.280 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>the annual gala</c>
<c.yellow>at Ford's Theatre tonight.</c>

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:45.240 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Yes, it's the theatre where</c>
<c.yellow>Lincoln was shot,</c>

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:48.000 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>yes, we're expecting the President's</c>
<c.yellow>Lincolnalia to be in rare form</c>

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.560 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>and, yes, the bad jokes</c>
<c.yellow>can start now,</c>

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.000 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>and that means I can't call on...</c>

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.600 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>See, I told you we were done.</c>

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:54.800 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white> </c><c.lime> Thank you, CJ.</c>

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:56.600 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>CJ, a source in the Pentagon</c>

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:59.200 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>says the military is funding</c>
<c.white>mind control experiments.</c>

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:00.800 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Mind control? Who are you?</c>

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.480 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>Randal Fierstin, Backslash Magazine.</c>

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:04.560 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Backslash Magazine? Oh, come on.</c>

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:07.440 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Who let you in here?</c><c.white> I have a</c>
<c.white>source. Two, in fact.</c>

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:10.320 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Randal, I meant bad jokes</c>
<c.yellow>about Ford's Theatre.</c>

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:12.160 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>So the White House has no comment?</c>

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:13.920 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>The White House in this dimension?</c>

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.560 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Backslash magazine...?</c>

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.440 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>You're dressed and ready to go.</c>
<c.white>This is true.</c>

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:19.800 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>I'm not.</c><c.white> Also true.</c>

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.400 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>Is there a reason you're</c>
<c.yellow>following me?</c><c.white> Do I need a reason?</c>

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.120 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>You're avoiding the President?</c><c.white> Yeah.</c>

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:25.520 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>I don't have to go, do I?</c>

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:28.600 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>Into the Valley of Death</c>
<c.white>rode the 600...</c><c.yellow> That's helpful.</c>

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:31.240 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.yellow>What do you know about mind control</c>
<c.yellow>experiments at the Pentagon?</c>

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:32.640 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>MK-Ultra.</c><c.yellow> Excuse me?</c>

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.320 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>In the '50s it was the CIA's</c>
<c.white>mind control research programme</c>

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:38.200 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>started in response to the Chinese</c>
<c.white>attempts on US prisoners.</c>

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:40.040 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white> </c><c.lime> Like the Manchurian candidate.</c>

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:42.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Like what's going</c>
<c.cyan>to happen to us tonight.</c>

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:44.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>You're ready, too.</c><c.cyan> It's a far, far</c>
<c.cyan>better thing I do...</c>

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:46.400 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Maybe things will be</c>
<c.yellow>different this year.</c>

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:47.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>JOSH AND TOBY: No.</c>

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:50.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>But it's long gone, yes?</c>
<c.yellow>Mind control?</c>

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>It worked on Freddie Briggs when I</c>
<c.lime>was 16,</c>

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:54.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>but look what happened to him.</c>
<c.cyan>Freddie Briggs?</c>

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>He was my first. Was he my first?</c>

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:59.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>16?</c><c.yellow> Is there a reason I'm the only</c>
<c.yellow>one who's not dressed?</c>

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Was your dress stolen?</c><c.yellow> No.</c>

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.880 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>Well, a copy of the</c>
<c.lime>Bill of Rights was stolen.</c>

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>There are copies of the Bill</c>
<c.yellow>of Rights lying around?</c>

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>George Washington sent copies to</c>
<c.lime>each of the 13 original colonies.</c>

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>North Carolina's got snatched</c>

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:11.400 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>at the end of the Civil war</c>
<c.lime>by one of Sherman's men.</c>

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:13.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Scintillating.</c><c.lime> The soldier was</c>
<c.lime>from Connecticut.</c>

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:16.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Josh is from Connecticut.</c>
<c.lime>Oh, that's right.</c>

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:19.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Go Whalers. Not a tonne to get</c>
<c.cyan>excited about in the Nutmeg state.</c>

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:21.960 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>The FBI seized the document -</c>
<c.lime>both states are claiming ownership,</c>

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>and the case has landed</c>
<c.lime>in federal courts.</c>

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.360 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Didn't North Carolina</c>
<c.yellow>steal the Whalers?</c>

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:28.400 align:middle position:50% line:70%
<c.lime>People are going crazy. The</c>
<c.lime>president's appearing in Raleigh</c>
<c.lime>next week.</c>

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:30.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>They're already handing out fliers.</c>

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>OK, who's on it at the AG's office?</c>

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>That would be Freddie Briggs.</c>

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:34.520 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>No.</c>

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>No, but I had you.</c>

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>16?</c>

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:40.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white> </c><c.cyan> ..gets oil imports</c>
<c.cyan>from the Persian Gulf.</c>

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:44.080 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>India, Southeast Asia and Japan are</c>
<c.cyan>also major consumers of Saudi oil.</c>

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:47.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>In a single world market,</c>
<c.cyan>the price of oil would be...</c>

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:48.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>260 billion barrels of oil.</c>

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:51.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>It's the epicentre of the</c>
<c.cyan>world economy.</c>

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>A civil war, a fanatical new regime,</c>

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:56.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>these could imperil our very way</c>
<c.cyan>of life.</c><c.white> Yeah, no kidding </c>

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.160 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Oh! Toby.</c><c.white> Yeah?</c>

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:00.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Was there something you wanted?</c>
<c.white>World peace?</c>

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:02.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Toby, I'm not protecting you.</c>

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Go hide from the President</c>
<c.yellow>somewhere else.</c>

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Out!</c>

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.680 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Waiting for your date?</c>

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.160 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white> </c><c.yellow> She's late. Go figure.</c>

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Well, you start dating</c>
<c.white>younger women...</c>

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:19.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I hear you're old enough</c>
<c.white>to be her father.</c>

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.320 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Al Jazeera's reporting 10,000</c>
<c.yellow>in the streets</c>

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:25.360 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>and protests now in Jeddah,</c>
<c.yellow>Buraydah, Rafha.</c>

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:27.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Was State able to find out anything?</c>

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:29.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>They're still digging.</c>
<c.yellow>Berryhill's en route to Jordan</c>

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:32.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>and the King's brother's on</c>
<c.yellow>his way down from New York.</c><c.white> Bitar?</c>

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:35.960 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I guess we're not the only ones</c>
<c.white>who think this is a thing.</c>

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.280 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c><c.white> I'll see you at the theatre.</c>

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:40.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Josh. Josh.</c>

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:41.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Hey.</c>

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:42.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>You might not want to be...</c>

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:47.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Have you been to Ford's Theatre?</c>
<c.lime>It's my first time, actually.</c>

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:50.920 align:middle position:50% line:70%
<c.cyan>Oh, well, you got to talk to</c>
<c.cyan>the President about Lincoln,</c>
<c.cyan>about the Civil War.</c>

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:53.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Sit with him. It's educational.</c>
<c.white>What are you doing?</c>

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>You're sitting ducks out there.</c>
<c.white>He's on his way.</c>

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:56.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Maybe if we don't ask,</c>
<c.cyan>don't mention...</c>

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Yeah, if you don't miss the easy</c>
<c.yellow>ones.</c><c.cyan> I didn't miss a question.</c>

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.400 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>It wasn't me.</c><c.yellow> We have to go</c>
<c.yellow>downstairs into the basement</c>

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>with him and open the damn museum.</c>

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:05.560 align:middle position:50% line:70%
<c.lime>What are you talking about?</c>
<c.cyan>Nothing. It's nothing.</c>
<c.cyan>You got to sit with him.</c>

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I'm not sitting with him. I</c>
<c.yellow>drew the short straw last time.</c>

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.680 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>He's going to start in with</c>
<c.white>Lincoln's first inaugural address</c>

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.320 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>and carry on straight through</c>
<c.white>to the letter Lincoln wrote</c>

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:16.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>to the woman who lost all her sons</c>
<c.white>who didn't really lose all her sons.</c>

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:19.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>You have Carl Sandburg's number?</c>
<c.white>Carl Sandburg is dead.</c>

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:21.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Oh, sure, Carl took the easy way</c>
<c.yellow>out.</c><c.cyan> Don't listen to them.</c>

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.880 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I'm not going to ask this year,</c>
<c.white>don't worry.</c>

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white> </c><c.lime> Good evening, Mr President.</c>

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:28.320 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I'm not going to ask</c>
<c.white>what was the line of dialogue</c>

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:30.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>that made the audience laugh</c>

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:32.400 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>that John Wilkes Booth</c>
<c.white>used as cover to enter</c>

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:33.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>the Presidential box.</c>

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.960 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I'm not going to ask about</c>
<c.white>the broken lock to the box,</c>

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:39.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>the snapping shin bone,</c>
<c.white>"Sic semper Tyrannis",</c>

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:41.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Major Rathbone and Clara Harris,</c>

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.800 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>or the exact time Lincoln</c>
<c.white>drew his final breath.</c>

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:47.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>I know that one. 7:21:55.</c>

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:49.120 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>And the final heartbeat?</c>

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:50.520 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>He had to open his mouth.</c>

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:52.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Every year, Josh.</c>
<c.white>Always the first one.</c>

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.520 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Angela, why don't you ride with me.</c>

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:58.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Ow!</c>

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:03.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Hi, Dad. Sorry.</c>

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>It's not nice to keep</c>
<c.yellow>the gentleman waiting.</c>

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:07.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Wow, I hardly recognise you.</c>

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:09.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Why is that, do you suppose?</c>

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Yeah, well, that's why we're here.</c>

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>So you can tell me</c>
<c.yellow>everything that's going on.</c><c.white> OK.</c>

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:17.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Did I mention I'm taking</c>
<c.white>that job in Tanzania?</c>

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Yeah, let's go.</c>

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:20.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>The President's dead.</c>

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.360 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>What's going on?</c>

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:22.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>What's happening, Dad?</c>

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:25.800 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Sir?</c>

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>President Lassiter is dead.</c>

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:37.320 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white> </c><c.cyan> Republican.</c>
<c.white>TOBY: Right-wing Republican.</c>

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:39.360 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.cyan>Conservative.</c>
<c.white>Attila the Hun conservative.</c>

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:42.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>A lunatic wife.</c><c.white> Lunatic,</c>
<c.white>Lady Macbeth of a wife.</c>

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:45.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Didn't Lassiter vote against</c>
<c.cyan>the emancipation proclamation?</c>

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:47.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I'm not writing the eulogy.</c>

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:49.680 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>You're riding shotgun</c>
<c.cyan>on Air Force One.</c><c.white> I am not.</c>

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:51.280 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>I thought it was a hip operation.</c>

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.800 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>All good things must come to pass.</c>

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:56.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white> </c><c.yellow> Angela Blake,</c>
<c.yellow>Lieutenant Colonel Castorp.</c>

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:57.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white> </c><c.cyan> It's a pleasure.</c>

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:01.040 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Colonel?</c><c.lime> I have the file here, sir.</c>

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white> </c><c.cyan> The file?</c>

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:04.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>The dead President's file.</c>

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:07.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Oh, this is Lieutenant</c>
<c.yellow>Colonel Castorp</c>

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>from the Military District</c>
<c.yellow>of Washington.</c>

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:11.880 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Upon a President's death,</c>
<c.yellow>his unit coordinates</c>

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>travel of dignitaries and</c>
<c.yellow>handles protocol</c>

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>in concert with the wishes</c>
<c.yellow>of the family.</c>

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:19.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>You keep a file on all</c>
<c.white>the presidents?</c>

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:20.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Yes, sir.</c><c.cyan> You got one on Walken?</c>

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Thanks, Colonel.</c>

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:24.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>President Lassiter's funeral</c>

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:27.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>will be held at the Lassiter</c>
<c.yellow>Library in Costa Mesa.</c>

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>The one with the fake Oval?</c>

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>And the President's giving</c>
<c.yellow>one of the eulogies.</c>

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:32.800 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I'm staying to monitor</c>
<c.yellow>the situation in Riyadh.</c>

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>I need CJ here to brief.</c>

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Toby, I don't want to hear about it.</c>

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:38.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>You're on Air Force One</c>
<c.yellow>writing the eulogy.</c>

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:40.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Josh, you'll help the</c>
<c.yellow>Lieutenant Colonel</c>

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:42.120 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>co-ordinate with Mrs Lassiter.</c>

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:45.280 align:middle position:50% line:70%
<c.cyan>Leo, I've got lawyers from</c>
<c.cyan>Connecticut and North Carolina</c>
<c.cyan>coming...</c>

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:49.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>What?</c><c.cyan> A Union soldier stole a copy</c>
<c.cyan>of the Bill of Rights</c>

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>at the end of the Civil War...</c>

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>We've got a dead president</c>
<c.yellow>and a time bomb in Riyadh</c>

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:54.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>and you're arbitrating the</c>
<c.yellow>Civil War?</c>

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>I did hear they're threatening</c>
<c.lime>to rally in Raleigh.</c>

00:10:57.160 --> 00:11:00.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Yeah. Introduce Donna to</c>
<c.yellow>Lieutenant Colonel Castorp.</c>

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:01.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Class dismissed.</c>

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:07.280 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Leo, I got a question yesterday.</c>

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:10.680 align:middle position:50% line:70%
<c.white>Tell me we're not conducting</c>
<c.white>mind control research at the</c>
<c.white>Pentagon.</c>

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>We're not conducting mind</c>
<c.yellow>control research at the Pentagon.</c>

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:16.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>You're not doing it on me right now?</c>

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:19.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Well, there might be something</c>
<c.yellow>at Darpa.</c><c.white> Darpa?</c>

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:21.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>The guys at DOD who research flying</c>
<c.white>cars and X-ray vision?</c>

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:25.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Also the guys who invented GPS,</c>
<c.yellow>stealth technology and the Internet.</c>

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Well, that's money well spent,</c>
<c.white>but if the public finds out</c>

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:29.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>we're spending taxpayer dollars</c>
<c.white>on mind control...</c>

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:30.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Give the DOD a call.</c>

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:35.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I have to baby-sit the first widow?</c>

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:37.520 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Beehive hair, dewlaps,</c>

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:40.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>hysterical phone calls</c>
<c.cyan>all hours of the day and night,</c>

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:42.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>and Lieutenant Colonel Castorp.</c>
<c.cyan>You're going to love it.</c>

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Why can't you do...?</c><c.cyan> I'm going to</c>
<c.cyan>be watching</c>

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.800 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>a re-enactment of Gettysburg</c>
<c.cyan>in the Roosevelt room.</c>

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:49.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Since when do you care about the</c>
<c.white>Bill of Rights, the Civil War...</c>

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:50.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Whaler pride.</c>

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.280 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>You sold me down the river.</c>

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:55.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>"Mine eyes have seen the glory</c>
<c.cyan>of the coming of the Lord."</c>

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:56.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white> </c><c.cyan> I love New York.</c>

00:11:56.520 --> 00:12:00.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>At dawn, the light on the water</c>
<c.cyan>towers on the tops of the buildings.</c>

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>A funny thing these water wells</c>

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:03.040 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>hundreds of feet above the ground.</c>

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:04.800 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Hell of a long way</c>
<c.white>to toss a canteen.</c>

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:08.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Prince Bitar.</c>

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:09.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Please.</c>

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:12.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>The prince was giving me</c>
<c.yellow>a virtual tour of New York.</c>

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:15.320 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Mr President, I come with greetings</c>
<c.cyan>from the Royal family,</c>

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>who again wish to convey</c>
<c.cyan>their pleasure</c>

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:19.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>at the way our countries have</c>
<c.cyan>weathered recent storms,</c>

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:21.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>in keeping with</c>
<c.cyan>our long-term friendship.</c>

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.680 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>And Leo here thought you were</c>
<c.white>coming to talk about the protest.</c>

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:27.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Protest? Hardly.</c>
<c.cyan>A few errant schoolboys.</c>

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:31.680 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>A few thousand schoolboys</c>
<c.yellow>and a couple thousand clerics.</c>

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:33.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>It's of no concern.</c>

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:35.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Your country's crying out</c>
<c.white>for reform.</c>

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:37.400 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>These things must be done</c>
<c.cyan>at the proper pace.</c>

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Well, you got more than 10,000</c>
<c.white>people who seem to think</c>

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:41.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>you're not moving fast enough.</c>

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>We've announced plans</c>
<c.cyan>for municipal elections.</c>

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:47.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I recall you passed a law to elect</c>
<c.white>municipal councils in 1975.</c>

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:49.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>It hasn't happened yet.</c>

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:51.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>You'll forgive us</c>
<c.yellow>if we don't hold our breath.</c>

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Mr President, do you really</c>
<c.cyan>wish to see the results</c>

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:55.640 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>of popular elections in my country?</c>

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:57.280 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>The Royal Family is very large.</c>

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:59.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>There are thousands of members.</c>

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:01.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>At times some have been...</c>

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:02.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>..less than progressive.</c>

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>But we do want change.</c>

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:05.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Manageable change.</c>

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:08.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>You'll keep us in the loop</c>
<c.white>on the situation in the capital?</c>

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:11.080 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Of course. And yet if things</c>
<c.cyan>suddenly become unruly...</c>

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:12.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I trust you'll consult with us.</c>

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:14.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>As friends do.</c>

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.640 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>As you would consult with us.</c>

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:18.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Thank you.</c>

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:26.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Mr President, when these</c>
<c.cyan>schoolboys protest,</c>

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:29.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>when they truly wish to denounce us,</c>
<c.cyan>you know what they say?</c>

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:30.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>They call us Americans.</c>

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.280 align:start position:20% line:83%
<c.cyan> </c>

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:08.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>I'm telling you, I'm gonna crank up</c>
<c.cyan>The Battle Hymn Of The Republic...</c>

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Toby: Josh, shut up.</c>
<c.white>You want a history lesson?</c>

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I'm in Madame Tussauds.</c>

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:14.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>All of Lassiter's men.</c>
<c.white>There's Robert Rosiello,</c>

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>who I think tried to sell</c>
<c.white>back Alaska</c>

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:18.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>when he was</c>
<c.white>Secretary of the Interior,</c>

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:21.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Max Pearlman,</c>
<c.white>who served three to five,</c>

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:23.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Earl Rankowsky, he's on oxygen,</c>

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.880 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Dwight Mothman,</c>
<c.white>they must've exhumed him,</c>

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:28.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>and Bobby Bodine, Josh.</c>

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:31.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>The one who said, "We have enemies</c>
<c.white>without and within</c>

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:33.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>"and we must purge"</c>

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:35.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>he actually used that word -</c>

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:38.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>"purge them all until we</c>
<c.white>are purified."</c>

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:39.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Purified.</c>

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:41.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Who needs Dante?</c>

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I'm on my way to hell</c>
<c.white>at 30,000 feet.</c>

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:46.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Hi. Uh, Josh Lyman.</c>

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Hi. Ralph Fairfax, from Fairfield.</c>
<c.cyan>You must be Marylou...</c>

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:51.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Meriwether, and a pleasure Mr Lyman.</c>
<c.white>Mr Lyman, wouldn't you agree</c>

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.680 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>that in the chaos and disarray of</c>
<c.white>war to make off with one of our</c>

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:56.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>state's most prized possessions,</c>
<c.white>a precious piece of our heritage,</c>

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:59.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>doesn't that sound more like raping</c>
<c.white>and pillaging than liberation?</c>

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>We bought it legitimately.</c>
<c.white>You stole it.</c>

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:04.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Well, I think we're off</c>
<c.cyan>to a promising start.</c>

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:07.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>It is a copy of the Bill of Rights.</c>
<c.white>It belongs to...</c>

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:08.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>To the Union. You seceded.</c>

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:10.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>This is why we needed</c>
<c.yellow>general order 100.</c>

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:14.600 align:middle position:50% line:70%
<c.cyan>General order 100?</c><c.yellow> The declaration</c>
<c.yellow>that all confiscated Rebel property</c>
<c.yellow>belonged to the Union.</c>

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:16.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Which was trumped</c>
<c.white>by special order 88.</c>

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:19.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Special order 88?</c><c.white> Mm-hm.</c>
<c.white>Issued by a Union general.</c>

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:22.200 align:middle position:50% line:70%
<c.white>"All archives and other</c>
<c.white>property entrusted to Carolina</c>
<c.white>must be returned."</c>

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:24.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Besides, the Bill of Rights made</c>
<c.white>100 unconstitutional.</c>

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:26.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>It violated due process.</c>

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:28.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>You know, one of my law school</c>
<c.cyan>classmates published an article</c>

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:30.880 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>on the constitutionality</c>
<c.cyan>of Lincoln's general order.</c>

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:33.040 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Akhil Amar.</c>

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:34.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>You went to law school at Yale?</c>

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Well, Yale's close to home so...</c>

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:38.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>You're from Connecticut?</c>
<c.white>You're from Connecticut?</c>

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:39.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Go Whalers.</c>

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:44.200 align:middle position:50% line:37%
<c.white>ON TV: Riyadh entered its third day</c>
<c.white>of demonstrations</c>

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:47.360 align:middle position:50% line:20%
<c.white>and while they are peaceful,</c>
<c.white>tensions remain high.</c>

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>The President on his way?</c>

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Yeah...of course, we had to get the</c>
<c.yellow>forklift out for Toby.</c>

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:53.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>CNN's reporting larger crowds</c>
<c.cyan>in the smaller cities.</c>

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:56.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Where are you going?</c><c.yellow> I'm meeting</c>
<c.yellow>Mallory at Oberdorfers.</c>

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:59.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I was supposed to take her to Ford's</c>
<c.yellow>Theatre the other night.</c>

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:01.880 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>With all that was going on</c>
<c.yellow>I kind of had to...</c>

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:03.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>I'll be back in an hour.</c>

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:06.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>The Darpa budget.</c>
<c.cyan>I thought it was classified.</c>

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:07.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>Apparently not.</c>
<c.lime>It's on the internet.</c>

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:10.360 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Hoisted on their own petard.</c>
<c.cyan>Any word back from the DOD?</c>

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:12.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>Not yet. But there's a man</c>
<c.lime>in your office.</c>

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:14.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>OK.</c><c.lime> I didn't see him come.</c>

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:16.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>I turned around, and he was there.</c>

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:18.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>A man in my office?</c>

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:20.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Is he dashing?</c>

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:22.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Not how I'd describe him.</c>

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Can I help you?</c>

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:29.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>There are no firewalls on here.</c>

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:31.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Excuse me?</c><c.white> I could certainly</c>
<c.white>do something with this.</c>

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:34.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Or I could call security to</c>
<c.cyan>do something with you.</c>

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:35.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Oh, sorry.</c>

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:37.120 align:start position:20% line:83%
<c.white> </c>

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:38.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I'm Dr Max Milkman,</c>

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:41.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>from the Defence Advanced Research</c>
<c.white>Projects Agency.</c>

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:44.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Dr Milkman?</c><c.white> Yes.</c><c.cyan> The man from Darpa.</c>

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:48.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Yes.</c><c.cyan> I've been reading about you.</c>
<c.cyan>Operation Midnight Climax?</c>

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:50.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Setting up brothels, creating</c>
<c.cyan>and testing LSD on the patrons,</c>

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:51.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>without their knowledge of course.</c>

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:53.800 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Talk about a mind-blowing</c>
<c.cyan>experience.</c>

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:56.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Please, Ms Cregg, that was Arpa.</c>
<c.cyan>Arpa?</c>

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Arpa, not Darpa.</c>

00:16:57.480 --> 00:16:59.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Well, I can't tell you</c>
<c.cyan>how comforting that is </c>

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:02.400 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white> </c><c.lime> Ladies and gentlemen, the</c>
<c.lime>tower's informed us</c>

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:05.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>we have clear weather</c>
<c.lime>for the rest of the way.</c>

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:07.120 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>You OK?</c><c.white> Do I look OK?</c>

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:08.640 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Not so much.</c>

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:10.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I think Bobby Bodine</c>
<c.yellow>was looking for you.</c>

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>"Enemies without and within."</c>

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>Thank you, Mr President.</c>
<c.yellow>Thank you, Mr President.</c>

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Thank you, sir.</c>
<c.white>PRESIDENT: Thank you.</c>

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:23.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Come on, I'll show you around.</c>
<c.yellow>Looks like a new plane.</c>

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Reconditioned</c>
<c.white>and re-configured, I think.</c>

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:27.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Don't care much for the colour.</c>

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>You should see what we've done</c>
<c.white>with the house.</c><c.yellow> The mauve house?</c>

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:32.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>What, shades of puce?</c>

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:33.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>I wouldn't doubt it.</c>

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:36.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Listen, I got the NSC</c>
<c.yellow>brief this morning.</c>

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Yeah, I wish they wouldn't do that.</c>

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:39.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>These protesters are talking about</c>
<c.yellow>democracy, Jed.</c>

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:42.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Well, we don't know what</c>
<c.white>they're talking about, DW. Not yet.</c>

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:45.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>The Royal Family...</c><c.yellow> They're a</c>
<c.yellow>convenience, getting fat and rich</c>

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:47.360 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>off the oil we gobble up,</c>

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:50.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>spending their extra billions</c>
<c.yellow>promoting radical Wahhabists.</c>

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:52.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>That was a bad bed we made.</c>

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Had to live with it in my day,</c>

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:56.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>but it's time for a change.</c>

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:59.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Trust the people, Jed. They'll make</c>
<c.yellow>rational decisions.</c>

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:00.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white> </c><c.cyan> In the deserts of Arabia</c>

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:02.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>are there any rational decisions?</c>

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:04.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Excuse me. Sorry, Mr President.</c>

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:06.360 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Raiding the pantry, Toby?</c>

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:09.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Just a prop, sir, to help me</c>
<c.cyan>with the eulogy.</c>

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>You know President Newman?</c><c.cyan> Yes, sir.</c>

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:12.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Voted for you a couple of times.</c>

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:14.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>You seem to be voting against me</c>
<c.yellow>at the moment.</c>

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:16.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>It's hard to get Toby to</c>
<c.white>speak his mind.</c>

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:17.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Mr President, it just seems to me</c>

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:20.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>that most Muslims on the</c>
<c.cyan>Arabian Peninsula</c>

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:22.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>believe they must choose</c>
<c.cyan>between the law of Allah</c>

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:24.120 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>and the laws of man.</c>

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:26.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I see. Arabs don't make</c>
<c.yellow>rational decisions,</c>

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:28.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>only fundamentalist ones?</c>
<c.cyan>Without strong guidance,</c>

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:30.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>the popular elections</c>
<c.cyan>could be a one-time event.</c>

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:33.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Strong guidance?</c>
