00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:35.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>No, I think we should run away,</c>

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:37.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>and as fast and as far away</c>
<c.cyan>as we can.</c>

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.960 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I think our friends in Britain</c>
<c.white>would argue</c>

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:41.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>it's the best way to</c>
<c.white>midwife modernity.</c>

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:44.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>And didn't they do a bang-up job</c>
<c.yellow>with the Arabian Peninsula.</c>

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:47.200 align:middle position:50% line:70%
<c.white> </c><c.lime> Mr President,</c>
<c.lime>President Bartlet. It's Leo, sir.</c>
<c.lime>Do you want...?</c>

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:50.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>No, I'll take it here. Would you</c>
<c.white>excuse us?</c><c.cyan> Mr President.</c>

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:57.000 align:start position:20% line:83%
<c.white> </c>

00:18:57.040 --> 00:18:58.160 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Yeah?</c>

00:18:58.200 --> 00:18:59.960 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white> </c><c.lime> Sir, there's been</c>
<c.lime>a development.</c>

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:03.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>Protesters have surrounded the</c>
<c.lime>Aramco facility in Dhahran.</c>

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>They're picketing</c>
<c.white>the Saudi oil headquarters?</c>

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:08.080 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>The compound includes 40 homes,</c>
<c.cyan>200 people,</c>

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>including 50 Americans.</c>
<c.white>Are they at risk?</c>

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:11.640 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>The protesters are refusing</c>

