00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:17.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Mr President,</c>
<c.yellow>we've also managed to identify</c>

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:19.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>a number of the leaders</c>
<c.yellow>of the protest.</c>

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:22.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>They appear to be renegade members</c>
