00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:28.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white> </c><c.cyan> The honour</c>
<c.cyan>guard will escort the casket</c>

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:30.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>from the library to the grounds</c>
<c.cyan>after the bugler's warm up</c>

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:32.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>but before they seat</c>
<c.cyan>the Presidents.</c>

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:34.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>The reverend will open and close</c>
<c.cyan>the programme</c>

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:35.680 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>and Mrs Lassiter requested</c>

