<c.cyan>give the final eulogy.</c>

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:38.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Mrs Lassiter also asked</c>

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:40.680 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>if she could have</c>
<c.cyan>five minutes with the President.</c>

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:42.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I feel like I'm on</c>
