<c.cyan>Charlie, is he singing?</c>

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:16.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>I don't think so.</c>

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:21.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white> </c>

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:22.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white> </c><c.yellow> Dhahran's the</c>
