00:23:09.600 --> 00:23:12.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>in the country. If they want the</c>
<c.lime>damn piece of paper so badly,</c>

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:14.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>why don't they just offer</c>
<c.lime>to compensate North Carolina?</c>

00:23:14.800 --> 00:23:16.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Oh, we'd be willing to pay.</c>

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white> </c><c.yellow> Come on, Bess.</c>

