<c.cyan>This is the new world order.</c>
<c.white> </c>

00:25:24.720 --> 00:25:27.360 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.lime>Mr President, we're ready</c>
<c.lime>for take-off.</c><c.white> Thank you.</c>

00:25:27.400 --> 00:25:29.720 align:start position:20% line:83%
<c.white> </c>

00:25:29.760 --> 00:25:31.960 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>CJ: It seems you're happy enough</c>
<c.white>to publicise your work</c>

00:25:32.000 --> 00:25:34.880 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>on micro/nano cameras,</c>
<c.white>gecko-fingertip adhesion,</c>

00:25:34.920 --> 00:25:38.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>something delightfully nicknamed</c>
<c.white>"Smell-o-vision."</c>

00:25:38.280 --> 00:25:41.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>There's the brain machine</c>
<c.cyan>interface programme.</c>

00:25:41.200 --> 00:25:43.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>It measures the processes</c>
<c.cyan>in the brain</c>

00:25:43.320 --> 00:25:45.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>in hopes of detecting</c>
<c.cyan>deceptive intent.</c>

00:25:45.320 --> 00:25:46.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>So not mind control, mind reading.</c>

00:25:47.000 --> 00:25:49.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>It's all part of a new</c>
<c.cyan>counter-terrorism initiative,</c>

00:25:49.760 --> 00:25:53.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>and the heart of our strategy</c>
<c.cyan>is bio-surveillance.</c>

00:25:53.040 --> 00:25:55.680 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>We're mining existing</c>
<c.cyan>health databases to determine...</c>

00:25:55.720 --> 00:25:58.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>You're looking at medical records?</c>
<c.cyan>It's totally anonymous.</c>

00:25:58.240 --> 00:26:01.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>You'll have social security numbers,</c>
<c.white>addresses, personal data.</c>

00:26:01.160 --> 00:26:02.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Just for the human ID Program.</c>

00:26:02.600 --> 00:26:05.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Human ID?</c><c.cyan> Human identification</c>
<c.cyan>at a distance -</c>

00:26:05.640 --> 00:26:08.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>where we use a variety</c>
<c.cyan>of biometric technologies</c>

00:26:08.800 --> 00:26:12.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>that focus on body parts,</c>
<c.cyan>face identification,</c>

00:26:12.160 --> 00:26:14.160 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>human Kinematics.</c><c.white> Kinematics...</c>

00:26:14.200 --> 00:26:15.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Oh, yeah.</c>

00:26:15.480 --> 00:26:18.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>It's amazing what we can tell</c>
<c.cyan>from the human stride -</c>

00:26:18.520 --> 00:26:20.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>personality, intention,</c>

00:26:20.520 --> 00:26:23.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>pathology, criminality.</c>

00:26:23.520 --> 00:26:25.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>All from scrutinising one's gait.</c>

00:26:28.000 --> 00:26:29.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Yeah.</c>

00:26:29.440 --> 00:26:31.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I got to go.</c>

00:26:38.440 --> 00:26:39.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>PRESIDENT: Hey.</c>

00:26:42.360 --> 00:26:43.680 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Thank you.</c>

00:26:51.320 --> 00:26:52.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>How you doing?</c>

00:26:55.680 --> 00:26:59.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I've been walking up</c>
<c.yellow>and down these aisles,</c>

00:26:59.320 --> 00:27:03.040 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>looking at these old men,</c>

00:27:03.080 --> 00:27:06.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>these great and terrible old men...</c>

00:27:08.960 --> 00:27:11.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>..and thinking</c>

00:27:11.120 --> 00:27:14.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>prosperous, free and democratic</c>
<c.yellow>Saudi Arabia</c>

00:27:14.080 --> 00:27:15.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>is something to wish for.</c>

00:27:17.360 --> 00:27:19.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>But the men on this plane</c>

00:27:19.240 --> 00:27:21.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>spent the better part</c>
<c.yellow>of the late 20th century</c>

00:27:21.880 --> 00:27:26.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>trying to play God in</c>
<c.yellow>other countries.</c>

00:27:26.160 --> 00:27:28.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>And the regimes they anointed</c>

00:27:28.480 --> 00:27:30.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>are the ones that haunt us today.</c>

00:27:33.600 --> 00:27:37.080 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Yeah, I'm not making much progress</c>
<c.yellow>with the eulogy.</c>

00:27:40.960 --> 00:27:43.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Did you ever meet</c>
<c.white>President Lassiter?</c>

00:27:43.800 --> 00:27:45.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>No.</c>

00:27:45.240 --> 00:27:46.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>He was an arrogant bastard -</c>

00:27:46.760 --> 00:27:48.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>pompous, high and mighty</c>
<c.white>know-it-all.</c>

00:27:48.880 --> 00:27:50.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>He used to call me in the residence,</c>

00:27:50.600 --> 00:27:52.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>wake me up in the middle</c>
<c.white>of the night</c>

00:27:52.280 --> 00:27:53.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>to pontificate on Teddy Roosevelt</c>

00:27:53.960 --> 00:27:56.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>or whatever president</c>
<c.white>had a birthday that week.</c>

00:27:59.120 --> 00:28:00.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>When we were elected,</c>

00:28:00.520 --> 00:28:02.880 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I really thought we were going</c>
<c.white>to own the place,</c>

00:28:02.920 --> 00:28:04.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>do it differently, better.</c>

00:28:06.280 --> 00:28:08.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Now I realise the men on this plane</c>

00:28:08.960 --> 00:28:11.800 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>are the only others</c>
<c.white>who have been there before.</c>

00:28:13.160 --> 00:28:14.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Who really know.</c>

00:28:16.880 --> 00:28:19.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I wished I'd taken</c>
<c.white>more of his calls.</c>

00:28:19.760 --> 00:28:21.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Sir, it's Leo.</c>

00:28:38.160 --> 00:28:39.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Hey.</c>

00:28:39.360 --> 00:28:40.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white> </c><c.yellow> Did Walken make it on board?</c>

00:28:40.920 --> 00:28:43.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>They really broke the mould</c>
<c.white>on that one. What do you got?</c>

00:28:43.240 --> 00:28:44.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Dhahran's quiet,</c>

00:28:44.360 --> 00:28:46.800 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>but there's been an outbreak</c>
<c.yellow>of fighting in Riyadh.</c>

00:28:46.840 --> 00:28:48.040 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>How serious?</c>

00:28:48.080 --> 00:28:49.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>A bunch of imams throwing stones.</c>

00:28:50.000 --> 00:28:51.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>A number of people were injured.</c>

00:28:51.800 --> 00:28:54.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>And they found Strasser,</c>
<c.yellow>the guy at the embassy.</c>

00:28:54.880 --> 00:28:57.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Says Arujunah</c>
<c.yellow>is a true reformer -</c>

00:28:57.280 --> 00:29:00.680 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>a believer in</c>
<c.yellow>checks-and-balances democracy.</c>

00:29:00.720 --> 00:29:03.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Wouldn't lie about chopping</c>
<c.white>down cherry trees.</c>

00:29:03.240 --> 00:29:05.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>That's the gist.</c>

00:29:05.800 --> 00:29:09.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>OK. Tell Alexander I want</c>
<c.white>the Truman battle group</c>

00:29:09.240 --> 00:29:12.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>moved into the Gulf.</c>
<c.white>And set up a call with Bitar.</c>

00:29:12.880 --> 00:29:14.640 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Sir...</c>

00:29:14.680 --> 00:29:15.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>It's time to tell him, Leo.</c>

00:29:15.880 --> 00:29:18.840 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Real change, or he can start looking</c>
<c.white>for a new kingdom.</c>

00:29:37.920 --> 00:29:39.920 align:start position:20% line:83%
<c.white> </c>

00:29:46.560 --> 00:29:47.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Hello.</c>

00:29:47.600 --> 00:29:50.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>DONNA: Well, at least you're not</c>
<c.white>singing. How is it?</c>

00:29:50.320 --> 00:29:51.440 align:start position:20% line:83%
<c.white> </c>

00:29:51.480 --> 00:29:52.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Oh, don't ask.</c>

00:29:52.880 --> 00:29:54.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>OK.</c>

00:29:54.960 --> 00:29:56.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>How is it?</c>

00:29:56.800 --> 00:29:57.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Sad.</c>

00:29:58.000 --> 00:29:59.360 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>It's...</c>

00:30:02.440 --> 00:30:04.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>It's just sad.</c>

00:30:12.600 --> 00:30:14.640 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Sir.</c><c.white> Mm?</c><c.lime> It's Leo.</c>

00:30:14.680 --> 00:30:17.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Thanks.</c>

00:30:17.120 --> 00:30:19.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Yeah.</c><c.yellow> Mr President, I'm with</c>
<c.yellow>Secretary Hutchinson</c>

00:30:19.680 --> 00:30:21.120 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>and General Alexander.</c>

00:30:21.160 --> 00:30:23.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>The National Guard have started</c>
<c.yellow>to fan out</c>

00:30:23.160 --> 00:30:26.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>around the protests</c>
<c.yellow>in Riyadh and Dhahran.</c>

00:30:26.280 --> 00:30:28.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Where's Bitar?</c><c.yellow> We haven't been</c>
<c.yellow>able to reach him.</c>

00:30:28.280 --> 00:30:30.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>He's apparently on a plane</c>
<c.yellow>back to Riyadh.</c>

00:30:30.480 --> 00:30:33.320 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>General, I want you to ready</c>
<c.white>a peacekeeping mission,</c>

00:30:33.360 --> 00:30:37.400 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>and, Leo, fax, Fed-Ex, carrier</c>
<c.white>pigeon, I don't give a damn how,</c>

00:30:37.440 --> 00:30:39.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>but get word to the Crown Prince -</c>

00:30:39.280 --> 00:30:41.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>any unprovoked use of force</c>

00:30:41.240 --> 00:30:43.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>and I'm going to freeze the sale</c>
<c.white>of all military arms.</c>

00:30:43.760 --> 00:30:46.800 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>We're going to stop training</c>
<c.white>his precious National Guard.</c>

00:30:46.840 --> 00:30:49.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Hell, tell him if he can use</c>
<c.white>saving American lives</c>

00:30:49.520 --> 00:30:51.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>as a pretext for force, so can I.</c>

00:30:56.480 --> 00:30:59.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Did you see all those books?</c>
<c.white>Mm-hm.</c>

00:30:59.040 --> 00:31:01.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Do you think Lassiter actually</c>
<c.yellow>read Shakespeare?</c>

00:31:01.280 --> 00:31:04.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I would have thought he was more</c>
<c.yellow>a Melville fan.</c>

00:31:04.560 --> 00:31:06.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>He called me, you know,</c>

00:31:06.520 --> 00:31:09.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>when we all found out</c>
<c.yellow>about your illness.</c>

00:31:09.240 --> 00:31:10.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>He must have been livid.</c>

00:31:10.800 --> 00:31:12.280 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>I was livid.</c>

00:31:12.320 --> 00:31:16.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I wanted to call the White House,</c>
<c.yellow>to call CNN.</c>

00:31:16.280 --> 00:31:17.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>And there was Lassiter on the phone</c>

00:31:17.960 --> 00:31:19.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>telling me to can it.</c>

00:31:26.960 --> 00:31:29.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>There's a Wilson quote -</c>

00:31:29.440 --> 00:31:32.960 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>"Is the present war a struggle for</c>
<c.white>a just and secure peace,</c>

00:31:33.000 --> 00:31:36.160 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>"or for a new balance of power?</c>

00:31:36.200 --> 00:31:39.360 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>"There must be</c>
<c.white>not a balance of power,</c>

00:31:39.400 --> 00:31:41.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>"but a community of power.</c>

00:31:41.440 --> 00:31:47.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>"Not organised rivalries,</c>
<c.white>but an organised common peace."</c>

00:31:49.000 --> 00:31:52.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Ah, what the hell. Woodrow Wilson</c>
<c.white>didn't have all the answers.</c>

00:31:52.160 --> 00:31:55.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>No. Neither did Lassiter,</c>
<c.yellow>God knows.</c>

00:31:56.640 --> 00:32:00.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>And then again, neither did I.</c>

00:32:01.400 --> 00:32:03.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>But at least at the end...</c>

00:32:04.360 --> 00:32:06.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>..we were all asking</c>
<c.yellow>the right questions.</c>

00:32:18.920 --> 00:32:21.080 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Hey, Glenn.</c><c.cyan> Mr President.</c>

00:32:21.120 --> 00:32:23.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Please.</c><c.cyan> Miss Libby's</c>
<c.cyan>looking for you.</c>

00:32:23.560 --> 00:32:26.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Is this gonna bother you?</c>
<c.white>Not at all.</c>

00:32:26.760 --> 00:32:30.400 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>World's certainly turned upside down</c>
<c.white>since Owen Lassiter's time.</c>

00:32:30.440 --> 00:32:31.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>True enough.</c>

00:32:31.920 --> 00:32:34.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Went on a trip to China</c>
<c.cyan>with him one time.</c>

00:32:34.080 --> 00:32:37.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>We had dinner in Beijing.</c>
<c.cyan>We couldn't find a bathroom.</c>

00:32:37.200 --> 00:32:38.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Talk about yellow peril.</c>

00:32:38.760 --> 00:32:40.720 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>The two of us are out</c>
<c.cyan>in the bushes</c>

00:32:40.760 --> 00:32:44.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>and Owen Lassiter's reciting</c>
<c.cyan>Lincoln's second State of the Union.</c>

00:32:44.320 --> 00:32:46.680 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>"The dogmas of the quiet past</c>

00:32:46.720 --> 00:32:49.880 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>"are inadequate</c>
<c.white>to the stormy present"?</c>

00:32:49.920 --> 00:32:51.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Something like that.</c>

00:32:53.360 --> 00:32:56.200 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>I lost touch with him</c>
<c.cyan>toward the end.</c>

00:32:56.240 --> 00:32:58.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>He started making all</c>
<c.cyan>those strange trips</c>

00:32:58.640 --> 00:33:00.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>to nonsense places,</c>
<c.cyan>old battlefields...</c>

00:33:03.240 --> 00:33:05.240 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>..but I can't help wondering</c>
<c.cyan>how he'd react</c>

00:33:05.280 --> 00:33:06.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>to the situation in Riyadh.</c>

00:33:10.360 --> 00:33:11.360 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Me, too.</c>

00:33:12.440 --> 00:33:13.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I'll catch up with you, Glenn.</c>

00:33:28.040 --> 00:33:29.600 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>How's it going</c>
<c.white>with Grant and Lee?</c>

00:33:29.640 --> 00:33:31.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>We're gonna hold</c>
<c.cyan>a signing ceremony.</c>

00:33:31.480 --> 00:33:33.280 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>Maybe even a 21-musket salute.</c>

00:33:33.320 --> 00:33:36.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>You reached an agreement?</c>
<c.cyan>The Union will stand.</c>

00:33:36.680 --> 00:33:39.800 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Freedom and the right to assemble</c>
<c.cyan>for one and all.</c>

00:33:39.840 --> 00:33:42.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Yeah, well, not if the man from</c>
<c.white>Darpa has anything to do with it.</c>

00:33:42.520 --> 00:33:44.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Ah, Darpa.</c><c.white> They're sifting through</c>
<c.white>medical records.</c>

00:33:44.800 --> 00:33:47.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>They're just trying to protect you.</c>
<c.white>Haven't you had enough trouble</c>

00:33:47.520 --> 00:33:49.400 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>haggling over the Bill</c>
<c.white>of Rights for one day?</c>

00:33:49.440 --> 00:33:51.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Does the press have the story?</c>
<c.white>Huh?</c><c.cyan> The mind-control story.</c>

00:33:51.960 --> 00:33:54.400 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.cyan>Didn't you say it was gonna break?</c>
<c.white>Yeah. So, the story breaks,</c>

00:33:54.440 --> 00:33:56.680 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>the public has roughly the same</c>
<c.white>reaction you're having.</c>

00:33:56.720 --> 00:33:59.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>No more mind control, no more</c>
<c.white>sifting.</c><c.cyan> No more gait scrutiny.</c>

00:33:59.520 --> 00:34:01.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Democracy in action.</c>
<c.white>You gotta love it.</c>

00:34:01.520 --> 00:34:04.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>..need to send in 30,000 troops?</c>
<c.lime>Initially.</c>

00:34:04.320 --> 00:34:07.520 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>And if this were</c>
<c.yellow>to move beyond peacekeeping?</c>

00:34:07.560 --> 00:34:09.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Yeah. OK.</c>

00:34:09.480 --> 00:34:10.920 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>I'll be down in a minute.</c>

00:34:10.960 --> 00:34:12.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Is it important?</c>

00:34:12.600 --> 00:34:14.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.cyan>No.</c><c.white> Not really, no.</c>

00:34:25.920 --> 00:34:27.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Hi, Dad.</c>

00:34:27.480 --> 00:34:29.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Mal. What are you doing here?</c>

00:34:29.600 --> 00:34:31.640 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I have something to tell you.</c>

00:34:31.680 --> 00:34:33.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>That's why I've been late.</c>
<c.white>I-I just didn't want to...</c>

00:34:33.960 --> 00:34:35.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>You all right?</c><c.white> Yeah.</c>

00:34:38.000 --> 00:34:39.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>No, not really.</c>

00:34:43.040 --> 00:34:48.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>It's hard for me because of who</c>
<c.white>you are...we are.</c>

00:34:51.240 --> 00:34:53.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Oh, I hate this. Can I just go now?</c>
<c.yellow>I don't think so.</c>

00:34:55.880 --> 00:34:57.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Mom's getting re-married.</c>

00:34:58.960 --> 00:35:00.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I know that.</c>

00:35:00.360 --> 00:35:02.400 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>You know that?</c><c.white> She called me.</c>

00:35:02.440 --> 00:35:05.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>She called you?</c>
<c.white>She said she didn't.</c>

00:35:05.160 --> 00:35:07.040 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Mal, I appreciate the concern.</c>

00:35:07.080 --> 00:35:09.000 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>I'm fine.</c>

00:35:09.040 --> 00:35:10.680 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>See, I knew it.</c><c.yellow> Knew what?</c>

00:35:11.880 --> 00:35:13.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I just didn't want you to hear it.</c>

00:35:15.120 --> 00:35:17.280 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>I didn't want you to be alone</c>
<c.white>when you heard.</c>

00:35:17.320 --> 00:35:18.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>It's OK.</c>

00:35:20.320 --> 00:35:22.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I'm just sorry we haven't</c>
<c.yellow>had more time together.</c>

00:35:22.960 --> 00:35:25.760 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I thought we'd have a nice night</c>
<c.yellow>at the theatre the other night,</c>

00:35:25.800 --> 00:35:28.320 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>but we got this little</c>
<c.yellow>problem in the Middle East.</c>

00:35:32.080 --> 00:35:34.480 align:start position:20% line:83%
<c.white>PLAYS "Taps"</c>

00:36:11.720 --> 00:36:14.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Ready! Aim! Fire!</c>

00:36:14.800 --> 00:36:16.120 align:start position:20% line:83%
<c.white> </c>

00:36:16.160 --> 00:36:19.280 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Ready! Aim! Fire!</c>

00:36:19.320 --> 00:36:20.840 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Ready!</c>

00:36:20.880 --> 00:36:22.360 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Aim!</c>

00:36:22.400 --> 00:36:23.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Fire!</c>

00:36:26.840 --> 00:36:29.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Mr President, I want to thank you</c>
<c.yellow>for coming.</c>

00:36:29.600 --> 00:36:31.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Of course I came, Libby.</c>

00:36:31.360 --> 00:36:33.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Owen would've loved the eulogy.</c>

00:36:33.600 --> 00:36:36.120 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Who wrote it?</c>

00:36:36.160 --> 00:36:39.640 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>The humour, so dry and...and sad.</c>

00:36:41.840 --> 00:36:43.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>I always thought you detested him.</c>

00:36:45.520 --> 00:36:47.040 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>That's a long time ago.</c>

00:36:49.000 --> 00:36:51.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I know he called you</c>
<c.yellow>just the other day,</c>

00:36:51.200 --> 00:36:53.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>but you didn't call him back.</c>

00:36:53.240 --> 00:36:55.600 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Several times.</c>

00:36:55.640 --> 00:36:58.680 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>But...you never called him back.</c>

00:37:07.960 --> 00:37:09.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>When we left the White House,</c>

00:37:09.600 --> 00:37:11.960 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>I thought we'd have</c>
<c.yellow>some time together.</c>

00:37:12.000 --> 00:37:14.320 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>His job was done,</c>

00:37:14.360 --> 00:37:16.680 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>but he took to travelling.</c>

00:37:18.360 --> 00:37:23.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>To Korea, to the Philippines,</c>
<c.yellow>to Vietnam and to Europe.</c>

00:37:23.680 --> 00:37:28.040 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>Any spot where American boys</c>
<c.yellow>had shed blood.</c>

00:37:28.080 --> 00:37:30.040 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Even the Civil War.</c>

00:37:31.240 --> 00:37:33.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>He'd fill a jar,</c>

00:37:33.280 --> 00:37:38.000 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>come back to this room,</c>
<c.yellow>this Oval Room he'd had built.</c>

00:37:40.040 --> 00:37:42.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>He'd come here to think.</c>

00:37:42.240 --> 00:37:45.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>He took to eating here</c>
<c.yellow>and sleeping here...</c>

00:37:47.800 --> 00:37:49.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>..even after the operation.</c>

00:37:51.840 --> 00:37:55.160 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>And when they came,</c>
<c.yellow>they found him here.</c>

00:37:58.400 --> 00:37:59.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Battlefields.</c>

00:37:59.760 --> 00:38:01.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Yes.</c>

00:38:01.480 --> 00:38:03.040 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>I wanted you to come...</c>

00:38:05.040 --> 00:38:06.760 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>..because he left this for you.</c>

00:38:09.120 --> 00:38:10.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Thank you.</c>

00:38:24.720 --> 00:38:27.640 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>"We owe it to ourselves</c>
<c.white>to stand in this dirt</c>

00:38:27.680 --> 00:38:30.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>"as survivors and witnesses.</c>

00:38:30.280 --> 00:38:32.560 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>"We have to cure ourselves</c>
<c.white>of the itch</c>

00:38:32.600 --> 00:38:35.920 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>"for the absolute knowledge</c>
<c.white>or power or right.</c>

00:38:35.960 --> 00:38:38.960 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>"We have to close the distance</c>
<c.white>between the push-button order</c>

00:38:39.000 --> 00:38:40.720 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>"and the human act.</c>

00:38:40.760 --> 00:38:42.440 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>"We have to touch people."</c>

00:38:42.480 --> 00:38:43.640 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.lime>Sir.</c>

00:38:46.560 --> 00:38:49.440 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.white>Did you talk to the Crown Prince?</c>
<c.yellow>We're too late, sir.</c>

00:38:49.480 --> 00:38:52.800 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>A protester in Riyadh</c>
<c.yellow>fired on the National Guard.</c>

00:38:52.840 --> 00:38:55.120 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>There was tear gas,</c>
<c.yellow>more gunfire...</c>

00:38:55.160 --> 00:38:56.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>A protester fired?</c>

00:38:56.520 --> 00:38:59.640 align:middle position:50% line:70%
<c.yellow>They think it was a member</c>
<c.yellow>of the National Guard dressed as</c>
<c.yellow>a protester.</c>

00:38:59.680 --> 00:39:00.880 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Are there casualties?</c>

00:39:00.920 --> 00:39:03.800 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>20, 30. Probably hundreds</c>
<c.yellow>more in the aftermath.</c>

00:39:03.840 --> 00:39:05.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Our people are safe?</c>

00:39:05.280 --> 00:39:07.480 align:middle position:50% line:77%
<c.yellow>The crowds in Dhahran</c>
<c.yellow>have dispersed.</c>

00:39:07.520 --> 00:39:09.960 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>Riyadh, Jedda, it's all breaking up.</c>

00:39:10.000 --> 00:39:11.560 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>And the leaders of the protest?</c>

00:39:11.600 --> 00:39:13.120 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>Arujunah?</c>

00:39:13.160 --> 00:39:14.240 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>No.</c>

00:39:16.240 --> 00:39:17.800 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>OK.</c>

00:39:17.840 --> 00:39:20.480 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.yellow>I guess this changes things.</c>

00:39:20.520 --> 00:39:22.200 align:middle position:50% line:83%
<c.white>I'm not sure it changes anything.</c>
